      "rev_n_21_30047a_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_21_30047a_0",
        "node_id": "n_21_30047a",
        "thought_text": "If neither of the above, check if any two tiles are in the same suit with a gap of 1 (e.g., 1 and 3) or same number but different suits (useless for immediate win). Actually, if no pair exists that can form a mentsu with 1 draw, check if any two tiles can form a mentsu with 2 draws. Otherwise return 2. Specifically, if no two tiles share a suit or number relationship allowing a 1-draw completion, the answer is 2.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "8316266097006844143",
