        "node_id": "n_22_6ec2c8",
        "thought_text": "Check if the hand already contains a mentsu (0 draws) by verifying if any three tiles form a triplet or sequence, or if any two tiles are identical (potential triplet) or form a gap of 1 or 2 in the same suit (potential sequence).",
