        "thought_text": "If 0 draws are insufficient, check if adding exactly one tile can complete a mentsu. This happens if there are two identical tiles (need 1 more for triplet) or two tiles in the same suit with a difference of 1 or 2 (need 1 middle or end tile for sequence).",
